{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36310","headline":"越州使院竹 · 方干","name":"越州使院竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫见凌风飘粉箨，须知碍石作盘根。\n细看枝上蝉吟处，犹是笋时虫蚀痕。\n月送绿阴斜上砌，露凝寒色湿遮门。\n列仙终日逍遥地，鸟雀潜来不敢喧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36310.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36310","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}